$ floe part check
exit 1
--- stderr
floe: FLOE_PARTS_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/parts) and FLOE_THEMES_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/themes) are one directory, or one is in the other, where floe would read the files of one as those of the other; make FLOE_PARTS_DIR and FLOE_THEMES_DIR two directories, neither in the other
$ floe check page.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
floe: FLOE_PARTS_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/parts) and FLOE_THEMES_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/themes) are one directory, or one is in the other, where floe would read the files of one as those of the other; make FLOE_PARTS_DIR and FLOE_THEMES_DIR two directories, neither in the other
$ floe render --out-dir $TMP/pages/page.yaml page.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
floe: FLOE_PARTS_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/parts) and FLOE_THEMES_DIR ($SAMPLE/own/themes) are one directory, or one is in the other, where floe would read the files of one as those of the other; make FLOE_PARTS_DIR and FLOE_THEMES_DIR two directories, neither in the other
